# Two independent branches with private periodic patterns, interleaved:
# 0x100 repeats a 5-iteration loop pattern (T T T T N) and 0x104 simply
# alternates (T N). Each pattern is trivial for a per-branch BHR, but the
# interleaved stream scrambles a shared GHR, so local history clearly
# outperforms global history here.
